# Delivery workflow (lean mechanism)

**Law:** Mechanism only. **Forbidden:** copying `baplatform` `stack.abp.*`, SaaS domain manifests, or another consumer's Jira wave maps wholesale.

## Lanes (when Jira/WBS adopted — T5)

| Lane | When | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Enrich | Unenriched / partial ticket | Human/agent enrich → Agent Zone specs; then Ready |
| Zero-SDLC-Crawl | Enriched + contract pinned | `scripts/jira-impl.sh` → Eng factory |

## Handoff

Ready Eng slice → rule `workflow.agentic-factory` + skill `brain-dispatch`.  
Qualified DEV → `workflow.qc-runtime`.  
**Done / Merge = human only.**

## Optional consumer files

- `delivery.tdd-dod` · `delivery.task-standard` · `delivery.qc-scenarios` · `delivery.jira*` — author per consumer; do not clone ABP.
